# There is no build tooling here on purpose — this repo is compiled by its
# consumers. But a consumer's checkout lives at `vendor/lobby` inside a real
# JS project, and one stray `npm` run in the wrong directory leaves a
# node_modules/ here that makes the whole submodule report dirty in the game
# that contains it. Which is confusing exactly when submodule state is already
# the confusing part.
node_modules/
